{
  "info": {
    "name": "Backend - Tickets",
    "description": "Collection kiểm thử API Quản lý Vé (Tickets) trên sàn pass vé TicketVerse. Sử dụng environment Backend Local - Events với baseUrl=http://localhost:7000 (không thêm /api). New uploads must be PDF. Create stores reviewTicketId; choose eventId explicitly. OCR warnings need manual review; automatic approval stays disabled. Updated 2026-10-11.\n\n## Email Gmail / Redis (2026-10-12)\nEmail defaults to disabled. Apply docs/email-schema.sql, configure EMAIL_ENABLED=true and Gmail App Password only in backend .env, start Redis (docker compose -f compose.email.yml up -d), then npm run worker:email. Redis URL defaults to redis://127.0.0.1:6380/0. See docs/email-notifications.md. Never put Gmail credentials in Postman.\n\nApprove (manual or automatic) sends ticket_approved to seller; Reject sends ticket_rejected with reason to seller. Recheck/upload alone sends no email. SQL outbox is committed with the review; delivery is asynchronous. Inspect email_outbox id/kind/status/attempts and the test seller inbox. HTTP success does not prove inbox delivery. No ticket PDF or QR is attached. Email contains notification text and a reference ID; no frontend configuration is required.\n\nUse a separate pending ticket for rejection. Replaying the same event does not create another notification. Failed messages stop after 5 persisted attempts; retry from backend CLI: npm run worker:email -- retry <outbox-id>. SMTP may duplicate delivery after a crash between acceptance and database commit. Local integration test: npm run test:email:integration (no real Gmail).",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_postman_id": "0ac7acad-5f6a-44b1-81eb-51082c7fac0e"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "01 - Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login USER",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.environment.unset(\"userToken\");"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Login successful\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  const d = pm.response.json().data;",
                  "  pm.test(\"Token received\", () => pm.expect(d.accessToken).to.be.a(\"string\"));",
                  "  pm.environment.set(\"userToken\", d.accessToken);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{userEmail}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{userPassword}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "auth",
                "login"
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
